security-audit,"全面的代码安全检查和服务器安全审计skill。适用于：(1) 代码漏洞扫描 - 检测SQL注入、XSS、SSRF等OWASP Top 10漏洞，(2) 依赖安全检查 - 识别过时或有漏洞的第三方库，结合实时搜索确认最新CVE，(3) 服务器配置审计 - 检查SSH、防火墙、权限等安全配置，(4) 敏感信息泄露检测 - API密钥、密码、令牌等硬编码检测，(5) 容器安全扫描 - Docker镜像和Kubernetes配置审计，(6) CI/CD安全检查。触发关键词：""安全检查""、""漏洞扫描""、""代码审计""、""security audit""、""vulnerability scan""、""SAST""、""dependency check""、""CVE检测""等。不用于：修复单个已定位的bug、编写新的安全功能代码、对无授权的第三方系统做扫描或渗透测试。",staruhub,ClaudeSkills,659,search_rank=374,search,https://github.com/staruhub/ClaudeSkills,https://github.com/staruhub/ClaudeSkills/blob/HEAD/skills/Geek-skills-security-audit/SKILL.md,staruhub/ClaudeSkills/skills/Geek-skills-security-audit/SKILL.md,1,,24,"NeverSight/learn-skills.dev, ThibautBaissac/rails_ai_agents, XSpoonAi/spoon-awesome-skill, aaaaqwq/claude-code-skills, ruvnet/ruflo, seb1n/awesome-ai-agent-skills, sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills, sundial-org/awesome-openclaw-skills",6a5f075051fb5dbba3d8c11cdf0ab804a3901f57,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""bandit"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pipx install bandit semgrep || pip install safety bandit semgrep pip-audit""}, {""package"": ""semgrep"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pipx install bandit semgrep || pip install safety bandit semgrep pip-audit""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""bandit"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""semgrep"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
