apify-financial-news,"Discover and extract financial news for tracked portfolio companies across 33 verified Tier 1 sources (Bloomberg, Reuters, FT, WSJ, IntelliNews, ČTK, PAP, BTA, TASR, ING Think, ECB, EC Press Corner, ...) plus broad Google News fallback. Use when the user asks to find news about a company, get press coverage, monitor financial press, run a news scan, or check headlines for a portfolio company. Reads tracked companies from data/companies.json. Do NOT use for marketing/social-listening (use apify/awesome-skills) or for morning-briefing formatting (out of scope).",apify,awesome-skills,239,search_rank=746,search,https://github.com/apify/awesome-skills,https://github.com/apify/awesome-skills/blob/HEAD/skills/apify-financial-services/skills/apify-financial-news/SKILL.md,apify/awesome-skills/skills/apify-financial-services/skills/apify-financial-news/SKILL.md,1,,0,,0c73590741d599f4bc648fe826c48202d5ecbbdb,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""apify-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- Apify access — preferred: `apify` CLI (`npm install -g apify-cli && apify login`); fallback: Apify MCP connector (`call-actor` tool). CLI is faster and preferred when both are available.""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""apify-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
