alchemy-agentic-gateway,"Use when accessing Alchemy APIs for RPC calls, token balances, NFT metadata, asset transfers, transaction simulation, or Alchemy-specific features. Also use when the user mentions ""SIWE"", ""SIWS"", ""x402"", ""MPP"", ""mppx"", or ""agentic gateway"" — this skill covers wallet-based auth flows for Alchemy's x402 and MPP protocols on EVM (Ethereum, Base, Polygon) and SVM (Solana).",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/moonpay/skills/alchemy-agentic-gateway/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/moonpay/skills/alchemy-agentic-gateway/SKILL.md,1,,0,,5cb73e1cf5ea325dcc3c85f427ad70d7f51fd41e,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""mppx"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g mppx""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""mppx"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 3, ""max_severity"": ""CRITICAL"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-8mhj-rffc-rcvw"", ""GHSA-8x4m-qw58-3pcx"", ""GHSA-mv9j-8jvg-j8mr""]}]"
alchemy-cli,"The Alchemy CLI (`@alchemy/cli`) is installed. Use `alchemy` commands for all blockchain data, wallet, webhook, and app management tasks instead of curl or raw HTTP. Covers auth setup, command discovery via `agent-prompt`, and common task-to-command mappings.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/alchemyplatform/skills/alchemy-cli/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/alchemyplatform/skills/alchemy-cli/SKILL.md,1,,0,,7989a3a5a87ac20836f8091f09562eacc9f429bc,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@alchemy/cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm i -g @alchemy/cli""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@alchemy/cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
alchemy-mcp,"Use the Alchemy MCP server (`https://mcp.alchemy.com/mcp`) for live blockchain data and admin work when MCP is wired into your AI client and the Alchemy CLI is NOT installed locally. Exposes 159 tools across 100+ chains for token prices, NFT metadata, transactions, simulation, tracing, account abstraction, Solana DAS, and app management. Use for live querying, analysis, admin work, or on-machine agent work — not for application code that ships to production. For application code, use the `alchemy-api` skill (with API key) or `agentic-gateway` skill (without). When the CLI is also installed locally, prefer `alchemy-cli` instead.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/alchemyplatform/skills/alchemy-mcp/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/alchemyplatform/skills/alchemy-mcp/SKILL.md,1,,0,,b969f74152b2f924bbe76f5f8bfeb0aeefa5c291,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@alchemy/cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""| Neither CLI nor MCP is available | install `alchemy-cli` (`npm i -g @alchemy/cli`), then use `alchemy-cli` |""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@alchemy/cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
