bys-remotion-template,"不一书Remotion模板生成器。通过一场强引导的分步访谈，帮用户（包括完全不懂代码的新手）生成一套长期可用的 Remotion 视频制作两件套：①专属《通用提示词模板.md》（每期视频复制填空即可开工）②自己风格的 _starter/ 工程底座（集中配色、通用组件、场景块、SRT字幕脚本、风格规范）。 当用户说""初始化 不一书Remotion模板生成器""、""初始化 bys-remotion-template""、""我想做一套自己的 Remotion 模板/底座/starter""、""帮我建视频模板""、""搭一套长期做视频的 Remotion 工作流""、 ""做一套我自己风格的视频模板""时必须触发；即使用户只是模糊地说""我想用 Remotion 长期做视频，帮我搞个模板"" 也应触发。不用于：直接做某一期具体视频（那是用户拿着生成好的模板去做的事）、与视频模板无关的 Remotion 编码问题。",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/qkgecn93/bys-remotion-template/bys-remotion-template/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/qkgecn93/bys-remotion-template/bys-remotion-template/SKILL.md,1,,0,,0580ed7fbf252f20524aa5536fa476a04bdd214a,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""still"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""环境允许时（Node 可用）：在 `_starter/` 里 `npm install`，用 `npx remotion still MyVideo out/frame.png --frame=N` 渲 2-3 张关键帧给用户看，确认和 HTML 效果图一致。发现偏差就修 theme/组件后重渲。环境不允许就明确告诉用户：\""模板已生成，第一次在你自己电脑上打开时，用 `npx remotion s""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""still"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
byted-volcengine-flink,"Entrypoint for managing Volcengine Flink (based on Apache Flink) workloads. Use it for developing and deploying streaming and batch jobs, diagnosing real-time issues (e.g., backpressure, checkpoint failures, OOM), troubleshooting resources, and performing SRE actions (stop/start/restart/scale/config changes). It intelligently routes requests to four specialized sub-skills and leverages flink-mcp for tool execution.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/bytedance/agentkit-samples/byted-volcengine-flink/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/bytedance/agentkit-samples/byted-volcengine-flink/SKILL.md,1,,0,,175bd4b4856020670303d01151f7807806793f68,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""mcporter"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g mcporter""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""mcporter"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
