chuinb,"This skill transforms users into confident industry insiders through immersive, research-driven learning experiences. It should be used when users want to quickly master an unfamiliar industry, field, skill, or domain — whether for professional networking, investment decisions, career transitions, or pure curiosity. The skill combines Feynman Technique, First Principles thinking, and 80/20 analysis with deep web research to generate beautifully formatted, media-rich learning notes with interactive flashcards and quizzes. Triggers include: ""help me understand [industry]"", ""I need to learn about [field] quickly"", ""make me an insider in [domain]"", ""行业速成"", ""快速掌握"", ""深度学习笔记"", ""/chuinb"", ""/master"", or any request to rapidly acquire domain expertise.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/yizhiyanhua-ai/chuinb-skill/chuinb/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/yizhiyanhua-ai/chuinb-skill/chuinb/SKILL.md,1,,0,,2fc433119482a9dd39ecfd1f061dd6a1f06e7ce8,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""yt-dlp"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install yt-dlp""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""yt-dlp"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 22, ""max_severity"": ""HIGH"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-3ch3-jhc6-5r8x"", ""GHSA-3v33-3wmw-3785"", ""GHSA-42h4-v29r-42qg"", ""GHSA-69qj-pvh9-c5wg"", ""GHSA-6v4j-43gg-vj32"", ""GHSA-79w7-vh3h-8g4j"", ""GHSA-c6mh-fpjc-4pr3"", ""GHSA-f7j3-774f-rfhj"", ""GHSA-g3gw-q23r-pgqm"", ""GHSA-hjq6-52gw-2g7p"", ""GHSA-v8mc-9377-rwjj"", ""GHSA-vx4q-3cr2-7cg2"", ""PYSEC-2026-2063"", ""PYSEC-2026-2064"", ""PYSEC-2026-2065"", ""PYSEC-2026-2066"", ""PYSEC-2026-2067"", ""PYSEC-2026-3430"", ""PYSEC-2026-3431"", ""PYSEC-2026-3432"", ""PYSEC-2026-3433"", ""PYSEC-2026-3622""]}]"
