dt-obs-react-native,"Integrate the Dynatrace React Native Plugin into a React Native or Expo project — dependency setup, dynatrace.config.js, Babel registration, npx instrumentation, navigation tracking, user privacy options, and verification. Handles both bare React Native and Expo (babel-preset-expo) Babel configuration automatically. Trigger: ""add Dynatrace to React Native"", ""React Native plugin setup"", ""instrument React Native app"", ""integrate Dynatrace RN"", ""mobile observability React Native"", ""react-native-plugin"", ""dynatrace react native"", ""add Dynatrace to Expo"", ""instrument Expo app"", ""Dynatrace Expo setup"". Do NOT use for: querying RN RUM data (use dt-obs-frontends), non-React Native mobile setups, or Dynatrace server-side configuration.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/dynatrace/dynatrace-for-ai/dt-obs-react-native/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/dynatrace/dynatrace-for-ai/dt-obs-react-native/SKILL.md,1,,0,,ff59ad8f870aa010e1619081958b4a5d34782f4a,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@dynatrace/react-native-plugin"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- **Under `devDependencies`:** Remove it and run `npm install @dynatrace/react-native-plugin`. The plugin is required at runtime including in release builds.""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@dynatrace/react-native-plugin"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
