faceless-explainer,"faceless-explainer video workflow - arbitrary text (article / notes / topic / brief) -> narrator_scripts.json + audio (voice + BGM) + section_plan.md -> typography / abstract-graphics / diagram / data-viz video. Typical length up to ~3 min (sweet spot ~30-90s); a genuinely longer piece is general-video, not this workflow. Generates its OWN narration (TTS) — it does not sync to a user-supplied / pre-recorded voiceover (that is general-video). No website capture, no real product screenshots. If the text names a product / its site to promote, that is /product-launch-video; when product-vs-topic is unclear, start at /hyperframes.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/heygen-com/hyperframes/faceless-explainer/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/heygen-com/hyperframes/faceless-explainer/SKILL.md,1,,0,,6343171bb3878e1af52ca5afe5f3c1c26d021706,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""doctor"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""macOS Apple Silicon or Linux x64. System tools: `brew install python@3.11 node ffmpeg` (use Homebrew Python, **not** `/usr/bin/python3`, or `pip install` is blocked by PEP 668); then `npx hyperframes ""}, {""package"": ""hyperframes"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""macOS Apple Silicon or Linux x64. System tools: `brew install python@3.11 node ffmpeg` (use Homebrew Python, **not** `/usr/bin/python3`, or `pip install` is blocked by PEP 668); then `npx hyperframes ""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""doctor"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""hyperframes"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
