Use when: implementing vector search with Google embeddings, building retrieval-augmented generation systems, creating semantic search features, clustering documents by meaning, integrating embeddings with Cloudflare Vectorize, optimizing dimension sizes (128-3072), or troubleshooting dimension mismatch errors, incorrect task type selections, rate limit issues (100 RPM free tier), vector normalization mistakes, or text truncation errors (2,048 token limit).",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/ovachiever/droid-tings/google-gemini-embeddings/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/ovachiever/droid-tings/google-gemini-embeddings/SKILL.md,1,,2,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,29657ed9134d9f059eff9ac809e7ee9783569b78,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""typescript"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -D typescript@^5.0.0""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""typescript"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
