install-openclaw-to-yc,"Autonomously set up an OpenClaw bot on a fresh Yandex Cloud VM in Kazakhstan (kz1-a, Karaganda). Asks the user for exactly two things — a Telegram bot token and one of three LLM access options (Anthropic API key, OpenRouter API key, or OpenAI Codex OAuth via ChatGPT Plus/Pro subscription) — then handles VM creation, hardening, OpenClaw install, CEO AI OS workspace seeding, Telegram pairing, chat_id auto-detection, and bot-reply verification on its own. The only other actions the user performs are pressing /start in Telegram once and (if Codex) confirming a device code on auth.openai.com. Use when the user says install OpenClaw to Yandex Cloud, deploy OpenClaw to YC Kazakhstan, set up my CEO bot in YC KZ, I am at OpenClaw workshop and need my own bot, create a Yandex Cloud VM for OpenClaw, or any close paraphrase. Targets a ~15-minute end-to-end run for non-DevOps users (founders, CEOs, marketing leads). Supports two modes of accessing Yandex Cloud — Plan A (the user's own YC Kazakhstan account via OAuth) and Plan B (a workshop-key bundle provided by the workshop organizer, for participants without their own YC account). The mode is auto-detected from the inputs. For local-machine OpenClaw install, use openclaw/install.sh in this repo instead. Companion skill openclaw-guide is required; prepare-yc-workshop is the matching organizer-side skill that produces the bundles consumed in Plan B; openclaw-user-onboarding is auto-invoked after Step 5 to collect the five basic facts about the user (identity, focus, style, tools, anti-patterns) and write them into USER.md so the bot is useful from message one.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/codealive-ai/ceo-ai-os/install-openclaw-to-yc/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/codealive-ai/ceo-ai-os/install-openclaw-to-yc/SKILL.md,1,,0,,c1da6735cc96ea42686906d4ba2a7dc3bed8a2a5,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""openclaw"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""| Cloud-init log shows `npm install -g openclaw` failed twice | `references/04-troubleshooting.md` §2 |""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""openclaw"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 590, ""max_severity"": ""CRITICAL"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-24vr-rprv-67rf"", ""GHSA-25gx-x37c-7pph"", ""GHSA-25pw-4h6w-qwvm"", ""GHSA-25wv-8phj-8p7r"", ""GHSA-275c-xpvc-jgfw"", ""GHSA-2767-2q9v-9326"", ""GHSA-27cr-4p5m-74rj"", ""GHSA-2858-xg23-26fp"", ""GHSA-2ch6-x3g4-7759"", ""GHSA-2cq5-mf3v-mx44"", ""GHSA-2f7j-rp58-mr42"", ""GHSA-2fgq-7j6h-9rm4"", ""GHSA-2hfg-4fh4-qp7f"", ""GHSA-2hh7-c75g-qj2r"", ""GHSA-2hm8-rqrm-xfjq"", ""GHSA-2mc2-g238-722j"", ""GHSA-2pr2-hcv6-7gwv"", ""GHSA-2qj5-gwg2-xwc4"", ""GHSA-2qrv-rc5x-2g2h"", ""GHSA-2rgf-hm63-5qph"", ""GHSA-2rqg-gjgv-84jm"", ""GHSA-2w79-r9g8-wmcr"", ""GHSA-2ww6-868g-2c56"", ""GHSA-2x4x-cc5g-qmmg"", ""GHSA-2xcp-x87w-q377"", ""GHSA-3298-56p6-rpw2"", ""GHSA-33hm-cq8r-wc49"", ""GHSA-33rq-m5x2-fvgf"", ""GHSA-354r-7mfh-7rh2"", ""GHSA-35mw-5vvr-vrxc"", ""GHSA-36h3-7c54-j27r"", ""GHSA-37gc-85xm-2ww6"", ""GHSA-37v6-fxx8-xjmx"", ""GHSA-392f-ggf5-fp3c"", ""GHSA-39mp-545q-w789"", ""GHSA-39pp-xp36-q6mg"", ""GHSA-3c6h-g97w-fg78"", ""GHSA-3c6j-hq33-3jv4"", ""GHSA-3cvx-236h-m9fj"", ""GHSA-3cw3-5vxw-g2h3"", ""GHSA-3fqr-4cg8-h96q"", ""GHSA-3fv3-6p2v-gxwj"", ""GHSA-3h2q-j2v4-6w5r"", ""GHSA-3h52-cx59-c456"", ""GHSA-3hcm-ggvf-rch5"", ""GHSA-3jx4-q2m7-r496"", ""GHSA-3pm9-5j7m-59vc"", ""GHSA-3pxq-f3cp-jmxp"", ""GHSA-3q42-xmxv-9vfr"", ""GHSA-3qpv-xf3v-mm45"", ""GHSA-3vvq-q2qc-7rmp"", ""GHSA-3w6x-gv34-mqpf"", ""GHSA-3wqp-prf6-2m72"", ""GHSA-3x3x-h76w-hp98"", ""GHSA-3xfw-4pmr-4xc5"", ""GHSA-3xv9-89fm-7h4r"", ""GHSA-42mx-vp8m-j7qh"", ""GHSA-43x4-g22p-3hrq"", ""GHSA-4564-pvr2-qq4h"", ""GHSA-45cg-2683-gfmq"", ""GHSA-4685-c5cp-vp95"", ""GHSA-474h-prjg-mmw3"", ""GHSA-47q7-97xp-m272"", ""GHSA-48vw-m3qc-wr99"", ""GHSA-48wf-g7cp-gr3m"", ""GHSA-49cg-279w-m73x"", ""GHSA