kling-cli,可灵 AI（Kling）官方 CLI 的使用技能：文生图 / 参考图生图 / 文生视频 / 图生视频。CLI 通过 MCP 服务与可灵交互： 调用 text_to_image / image_to_image / text_to_video / image_to_video（模型与参数规格由 who_am_i 动态声明）， 返回 generation_id 后用 query_tasks 轮询，完成后提取 works[].url 展示给用户。命令无别名。 触发词：可灵、Kling、文生图、参考图生图、文生视频、图生视频、Omni、omni、MCP、generation_id、轮询、灵感值、 text_to_image、image_to_image、text_to_video、image_to_video、query_tasks、who_am_i、file_upload、 image generation、video generation、kling 命令、.credentials、 国内站、海外站、global、海外版、区域、region、安装、install。,NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/klingai-tech/skills/kling-cli/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/klingai-tech/skills/kling-cli/SKILL.md,1,,0,,8280ec6c421aabd5dc2cc1ecd316b621ac5a248d,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@klingai/cli-cn"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""| 中国区 | https://klingai.com | 账号登录 klingai.com（中国大陆） | `npm i -g @klingai/cli-cn --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org` |""}, {""package"": ""@klingai/cli-global"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""| 非中国区 | https://kling.ai | 账号登录 kling.ai（海外站 / global） | `npm i -g @klingai/cli-global --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org` |""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@klingai/cli-cn"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""@klingai/cli-global"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
