kos,"Use this skill when the user wants to set up a new Kodex OS Layer 1 vault (the LLM Wiki layer) from scratch. Triggers include phrases like ""set up kos"", ""create a new kos vault"", ""initialize my Kodex Wiki"", or any first-time setup request. This skill walks the user through naming the vault, choosing a location, scaffolding the directory structure (raw/ with FL/FR/FS memo book conventions, wiki/ with all six subdirectories, output/), installing SCHEMA.md, and wiring up their AI agent. Do not use this skill if a vault already exists — use kos-ingest, kos-query, or kos-lint instead. Do not use for Layer 0 (Field Notes), Layer 2 (Notion), Layer 3 (Archive), or Layer 4 (Trello) setup.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/k0d3x8its/kos/kos/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/k0d3x8its/kos/kos/SKILL.md,1,,0,,07fe24e343323060630d6bb17b9b411b34b9da10,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@steipete/summarize"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- summarize: `npm i -g @steipete/summarize`""}, {""package"": ""@tobilu/qmd"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- qmd: `npm i -g @tobilu/qmd`""}, {""package"": ""agent-browser"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- agent-browser: `npm i -g agent-browser && agent-browser install`""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""@steipete/summarize"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 5, ""max_severity"": ""HIGH"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-2r69-qgv3-hr65"", ""GHSA-5624-2pmv-jx46"", ""GHSA-67gq-6q8c-qqh6"", ""GHSA-8jr4-6r33-phwm"", ""GHSA-qp7v-gjgg-4mj6""]}, {""package"": ""@tobilu/qmd"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""agent-browser"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
