mem-skill,"Self-evolving memory and knowledge accumulation system for AI agents. Acts as a persistent 'second brain' that automatically retrieves past experiences, captures best practices, and proactively records successful solutions to a private knowledge base. Use this skill whenever starting any task, opening a new conversation, or triggering any other skill. Supports memory engines (default: built-in JSON/Markdown index; optional: QMD semantic search). Initialize with: /mem-skill init [--mem-engine=qmd].",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/oliguo/mem-skill/mem-skill/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/oliguo/mem-skill/mem-skill/SKILL.md,1,,0,,452eb49d0906482014fa56e281ad5b2cbb3fb630,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@tobilu/qmd"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""> \""QMD is not installed. Install it now with `npm install -g @tobilu/qmd`? (QMD requires Node.js >= 22)\""""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@tobilu/qmd"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
mem0-cli,"Mem0 CLI -- the command-line interface for mem0 memory operations. TRIGGER when: user mentions ""mem0 cli"", ""mem0 command line"", ""@mem0/cli"", ""mem0-cli"", ""pip install mem0-cli"", ""npm install -g @mem0/cli"", or is running mem0 commands in a terminal/shell (mem0 add, mem0 search, mem0 list, mem0 get, mem0 init, mem0 config, mem0 import). Also triggers when query includes CLI flags like --user-id, --output, --json, --agent, or describes bash/zsh/terminal/shell usage. DO NOT TRIGGER when: user asks about programmatic SDK integration in Python/TS code (use mem0 skill), or Vercel AI SDK provider (use mem0-vercel-ai-sdk skill).",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/mem0ai/mem0/mem0-cli/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/mem0ai/mem0/mem0-cli/SKILL.md,1,,1,mem0ai/mem0,1603f0927aebb49581dcb47359e5eef8459264fd,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@mem0/cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g @mem0/cli""}, {""package"": ""mem0-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install mem0-cli""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@mem0/cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""mem0-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
mem0-integrate,"Integrate Mem0 into an existing repository using a goal-driven, TDD pipeline. Detects the repo's language automatically and asks the user to pick between Mem0 Platform (managed) and Mem0 Open Source (self-hosted). Writes failing tests before any implementation. Produces a local feature branch plus `.mem0-integration/` artifacts consumed by the paired verification skill. TRIGGER when: user says ""integrate mem0"", ""add mem0 to this repo"", ""wire mem0 into <repo>"", or asks how to add memory to an existing project. DO NOT TRIGGER when: the user wants general SDK usage (use skill:mem0), CLI usage (use skill:mem0-cli), or Vercel AI SDK (use skill:mem0-vercel-ai-sdk). After success, invoke skill:mem0-test-integration to verify in the same workspace (loose coupling).",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/mem0ai/mem0/mem0-integrate/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/mem0ai/mem0/mem0-integrate/SKILL.md,1,,1,mem0ai/mem0,39b335876549893ce3f4bdff617b6bfcb5955e5c,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@mem0/cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""If `MEM0_API_KEY` is missing AND the track is **Platform** → **default to Agent Mode**: run `mem0 init --agent --agent-caller <your-name> --json` (after `pip install mem0-cli` or `npm install -g @mem0""}, {""package"": ""mem0-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""If `MEM0_API_KEY` is missing AND the track is **Platform** → **default to Agent Mode**: run `mem0 init --agent --agent-caller <your-name> --json` (after `pip install mem0-cli` or `npm install -g @mem0""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@mem0/cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""mem0-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
