opendataloader-pdf,"PDF 数据提取工具。当用户提到""PDF 提取""、""PDF 转 Markdown""、""PDF 解析""、""提取 PDF 内容""、""PDF 转 JSON""、""RAG PDF""时使用。OpenDataLoader PDF 是目前基准测试第一的 PDF 解析器，支持本地模式（快速、确定）和混合 AI 模式（复杂表格、扫描件、公式），输出 Markdown、JSON（带边界框）、HTML。适用于需要从 PDF 提取结构化数据用于 RAG/LLM pipeline，或需要批量处理 PDF 文档的场景。",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/chujianyun/skills/opendataloader-pdf/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/chujianyun/skills/opendataloader-pdf/SKILL.md,1,,0,,a3870b28c9ad371aefd29abf4b94d83d538ad64c,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@opendataloader/pdf"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- npm：`npm install @opendataloader/pdf`""}, {""package"": ""opendataloader-pdf"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""- PyPI：`pip install opendataloader-pdf`""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@opendataloader/pdf"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""opendataloader-pdf"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
