privacy-mask,"Mask, redact, anonymize and censor sensitive information (PII) in screenshots and images — phone numbers, emails, IDs, API keys, crypto wallets, credit cards, passwords, and more. Uses OCR (Tesseract + RapidOCR) with 47 regex rules and optional NER (GLiNER) to detect private data and applies blur/fill redaction overlays. Supports GDPR and compliance workflows, secret detection, and data loss prevention (DLP). All processing runs 100% locally and offline — no data leaves your machine.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/fullstackcrew-alpha/privacy-mask/privacy-mask/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/fullstackcrew-alpha/privacy-mask/privacy-mask/SKILL.md,1,,1,sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills,94e36d6cc66719e0682a3e40935b510683abfb29,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""privacy-mask"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""1. Install via pip: `pip install privacy-mask`""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""privacy-mask"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
