simple-web-design,"Apply proven simple web design principles to critique, audit, improve, or build website UI and UX. Trigger this skill whenever a user asks for design feedback, a UX review, landing page critique, or help designing any web interface — even when phrased casually as ""does this look good?"", ""what's wrong with my site?"", ""how do I improve UX?"", ""review my homepage"", ""make my app feel cleaner"", or ""help me design a page"". Also applies when the user provides HTML/CSS code or image data for design review. This skill is grounded in Anthony Hobday's ""Simple Web Design"" framework: 15 battle-tested principles that prioritize content, clarity, and long-term usability over visual complexity and trend-chasing.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/nomideusz/simple-web-design/simple-web-design/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/nomideusz/simple-web-design/simple-web-design/SKILL.md,1,,0,,3505c649b133eeb5f41dd79c3f783ccb2b45ad6b,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@anthropic-ai/sdk"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install @anthropic-ai/sdk""}]",B,"[{""package"": ""@anthropic-ai/sdk"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 2, ""max_severity"": ""MODERATE"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-5474-4w2j-mq4c"", ""GHSA-p7fg-763f-g4gf""]}]"
