skill-doctor,"Environment diagnostics — check providers, auth, config, hooks, scheduler, and more. Use when: AUTOMATICALLY ACTIVATE when user asks about:. \""doctor\"" or \""run doctor\"" or \""diagnostics\"". \""check my setup\"" or \""is everything working\",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/nyldn/claude-octopus/skill-doctor/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/nyldn/claude-octopus/skill-doctor/SKILL.md,1,,3,"NeverSight/learn-skills.dev, paulrberg/agent-skills",b918dbcad86d95f5a4586f99081e44cac91c468a,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@openai/codex"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""| Codex CLI not found | `npm install -g @openai/codex` or install via `codex login` |""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""@openai/codex"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 2, ""max_severity"": ""CRITICAL"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-w5fx-fh39-j5rw"", ""GHSA-xrxf-jgv3-qmrm""]}]"
