slide-deck,"When you want to draft, update, convert, or export a slide deck for a React/Next.js slide system (e.g., corey.co/slides) (${SLIDE_DECK_REPO:-$HOME/code/your-slide-deck-site}/src/app/slides/). Writes TypeScript Slide[] arrays using your primitives (Eyebrow, Heading, Accent, Body, BulletList, Divider, TwoCol, GradientText), 12 cycling brand gradients, optional sections for ""where am I"" context, and speaker notes. Inspired by zarazhangrui/frontend-slides — ""show, don't tell"" applied to narrative (presents 3 angles, you pick) plus density modes (speaker-led vs reading-first). Four modes — new (draft from brief), update (modify existing, with overflow guards), ppt (convert legacy PPTX → React deck), export (Playwright snapshot existing React deck to standalone HTML, PDF, or Vercel URL — keeps brand). Triggers on ""/slide-deck,"" ""/slides new,"" ""/slides export,"" ""/slides update,"" ""/slides ppt,"" ""draft a deck,"" ""deck for [topic],"" ""talk on [topic],"" ""keynote on [topic],"" ""internal deck for [audience],"" ""convert this pptx,"" ""export this deck.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/coreyhaines31/makerskills/slide-deck/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/coreyhaines31/makerskills/slide-deck/SKILL.md,1,,4,"NeverSight/learn-skills.dev, coreyhaines31/makerskills",47055df665c86450f10c6a37d273f8236bec5c05,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""python-pptx"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install python-pptx 2>/dev/null""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""python-pptx"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
slide-generation,"Use this skill to create presentation slides from structured content. Triggers: ""create slides"", ""generate presentation"", ""make powerpoint"", ""create pptx"", ""build slides"", ""presentation from content"", ""slide deck"", ""slides for"" Outputs: PPTX files, Markdown slides, or HTML presentations. Used by: pitch-deck-agent, market-researcher-agent, and other agents needing slides.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/michaelboeding/skills/slide-generation/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/michaelboeding/skills/slide-generation/SKILL.md,1,,1,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,3fa94033b8461ea942d86020fb7984752e0cb854,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""@marp-team/marp-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g @marp-team/marp-cli""}, {""package"": ""python-pptx"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install python-pptx Pillow""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""@marp-team/marp-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""python-pptx"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
slides-polish,"Per-page Codex review + targeted python-pptx / Beamer fixes for academic talk slides. Use AFTER /paper-slides (or any externally generated PPTX/Beamer) when the deck looks 'mostly OK' but the user wants a final pass that aligns visual weight with a reference, bumps PPTX fonts to projector-readable size, kills italic style leaks, fixes text-frame overflow, and catches per-slide layout drift. Trigger phrases: \""polish slides\"", \""slides 排版不对\"", \""PPTX 字体太小\"", \""和 Beamer 比一下\"", \""per-page review\"", \""和 codex 一页一页过\"".",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/wanshuiyin/auto-claude-code-research-in-sleep/slides-polish/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/wanshuiyin/auto-claude-code-research-in-sleep/slides-polish/SKILL.md,1,,0,,07aad03984dcbb09d7feb07d2fd2a99bffa14c29,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""python-pptx"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""- **Python**: `python3` with `python-pptx>=0.6` (`pip install python-pptx`).""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""python-pptx"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
slides-to-pptx,"Create stunning, animation-rich HTML presentations from scratch or by converting PowerPoint files, with optional PPTX export via PptxGenJS. Features 12 curated style presets, visual style discovery, viewport-perfect slides, inline editing, and end-to-end content-to-PowerPoint workflow.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/tonylonga/slides-to-pptx/slides-to-pptx/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/tonylonga/slides-to-pptx/slides-to-pptx/SKILL.md,1,,0,,582b3e1aac8f255a4c815258c3dd5549d2e1fb36,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""playwright"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install playwright pptxgenjs""}, {""package"": ""python-pptx"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""1. **Extract content** — Run `python scripts/extract-pptx.py <input.pptx> <output_dir>` (install python-pptx if needed: `pip install python-pptx`)""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""playwright"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 1, ""max_severity"": ""HIGH"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-7mvr-c777-76hp""]}, {""package"": ""python-pptx"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
