us-cpi-pce-comparator,自動比較美國 CPI（固定權重）與 PCE（動態權重）的通膨訊號，識別低波動高權重桶位的 PCE 上行風險。用於分析 Fed 關注的 PCE 是否正在 re-accelerate，即使 CPI 看似降溫。,NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/fatfingererr/macro-skills/us-cpi-pce-comparator/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/fatfingererr/macro-skills/us-cpi-pce-comparator/SKILL.md,1,,0,,968d223689418e84851f3bd524c8dff4bd4fa704,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""pandas"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install pandas numpy requests  # 首次使用""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""pandas"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 1, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": [""PYSEC-2020-73""]}]"
