wjs-dubbing-video,"Use when the user has a video + a target-language SRT and wants the video to actually speak that language — generates a time-aligned TTS voice dub. Routes by voice ID — Volcano (豆包) TTS for Chinese, edge-tts neural for any language. Defaults to one voice (single-speaker); opt-in multi-speaker via visual diarization. Outputs `*_<lang>_dub.mp4` with the dub audio in place of the original. Final mixing (audio bed + burn-in) is handed off to `/wjs-burning-subtitles`. Triggers — ""配音"", ""中文配音"", ""Chinese dub"", ""voice over this"", ""dub the video"", ""TTS this SRT"", ""different voice for each speaker"".",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/jianshuo/claude-skills/wjs-dubbing-video/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/jianshuo/claude-skills/wjs-dubbing-video/SKILL.md,1,,0,,0916774a786bd3379892dad967ec5b720611e4d1,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""opencv-python"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""uv pip install --python .venv/bin/python mediapipe opencv-python""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""opencv-python"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 62, ""max_severity"": ""HIGH"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-267x-w5hx-8hjr"", ""GHSA-33h2-69j3-r336"", ""GHSA-3448-vrgh-85xr"", ""GHSA-5rpc-gwh9-q9fg"", ""GHSA-634c-v2xv-ffpg"", ""GHSA-6v6p-p97v-g2p7"", ""GHSA-83rh-hx5x-q9p5"", ""GHSA-8849-5h85-98qw"", ""GHSA-89rj-5ggj-3p9p"", ""GHSA-8w3x-457r-wg53"", ""GHSA-9g8h-pjm4-q92p"", ""GHSA-c7gp-2pch-qh2v"", ""GHSA-cvhw-2593-5j2q"", ""GHSA-fffj-9qwg-qmh5"", ""GHSA-fm39-cw8h-3p63"", ""GHSA-fr58-2xhv-qp3w"", ""GHSA-fvq6-392h-6mjj"", ""GHSA-fw99-f933-rgh8"", ""GHSA-hxfw-jm98-v4mq"", ""GHSA-jcxv-2j3h-mg59"", ""GHSA-jggw-2q6g-c3m6"", ""GHSA-m43c-649m-pm48"", ""GHSA-m6vm-8g8v-xfjh"", ""GHSA-pqjj-6f5q-gqph"", ""GHSA-q799-q27x-vp7w"", ""GHSA-qr4w-53vh-m672"", ""GHSA-rqxg-xvcq-3v2f"", ""GHSA-vc29-rj92-gc7j"", ""GHSA-w96g-3p64-63w