wjs-reframing-video,"Use when the user wants to convert a video between horizontal and vertical orientations while preserving the inverted aspect ratio (16:9 ↔ 9:16, 4:3 ↔ 3:4, 21:9 ↔ 9:21). The skill crops a narrow band from the source and tracks the active speaker — the person whose mouth is moving — via MediaPipe face landmarks and mouth-aspect-ratio variance, so the talker stays in frame even when other people are visible. Triggers — ""横转竖"", ""竖转横"", ""做成竖屏发抖音/视频号/小红书"", ""16:9 to 9:16"", ""make this vertical for Reels / TikTok / YouTube Shorts"", ""crop to portrait"", ""convert to landscape"".",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/jianshuo/claude-skills/wjs-reframing-video/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/jianshuo/claude-skills/wjs-reframing-video/SKILL.md,1,,0,,01bbc3c6ce01b6252f9ea5c91cffdbb2105050c8,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""opencv-python"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install mediapipe opencv-python numpy""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""opencv-python"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 62, ""max_severity"": ""HIGH"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-267x-w5hx-8hjr"", ""GHSA-33h2-69j3-r336"", ""GHSA-3448-vrgh-85xr"", ""GHSA-5rpc-gwh9-q9fg"", ""GHSA-634c-v2xv-ffpg"", ""GHSA-6v6p-p97v-g2p7"", ""GHSA-83rh-hx5x-q9p5"", ""GHSA-8849-5h85-98qw"", ""GHSA-89rj-5ggj-3p9p"", ""GHSA-8w3x-457r-wg53"", ""GHSA-9g8h-pjm4-q92p"", ""GHSA-c7gp-2pch-qh2v"", ""GHSA-cvhw-2593-5j2q"", ""GHSA-fffj-9qwg-qmh5"", ""GHSA-fm39-cw8h-3p63"", ""GHSA-fr58-2xhv-qp3w"", ""GHSA-fvq6-392h-6mjj"", ""GHSA-fw99-f933-rgh8"", ""GHSA-hxfw-jm98-v4mq"", ""GHSA-jcxv-2j3h-mg59"", ""GHSA-jggw-2q6g-c3m6"", ""GHSA-m43c-649m-pm48"", ""GHSA-m6vm-8g8v-xfjh"", ""GHSA-pqjj-6f5q-gqph"", ""GHSA-q799-q27x-vp7w"", ""GHSA-qr4w-53vh-m672"", ""GHSA-rqxg-xvcq-3v2f"", ""GHSA-vc29-rj92-gc7j"", ""GHSA-w96g-3p64-63wr"", ""GHSA-wq8f-wvqp-xvvm"", ""GHSA-x3rm