yt-dlp,"Download audio and video from thousands of websites using yt-dlp. Feature-rich command-line tool supporting format selection, subtitle extraction, playlist handling, metadata embedding, and post-processing. This skill is triggered when the user says things like ""download this video"", ""download from YouTube"", ""extract audio from video"", ""download this playlist"", ""get the mp3 from this video"", ""download subtitles"", or ""save this video locally"".",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/seckatie/katies-ai-skills/yt-dlp/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/seckatie/katies-ai-skills/yt-dlp/SKILL.md,1,,3,"NeverSight/learn-skills.dev, TerminalSkills/skills",d8294de95bb62f59fe888919908ed1daa98a8895,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""yt-dlp"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install yt-dlp""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""yt-dlp"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 22, ""max_severity"": ""HIGH"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-3ch3-jhc6-5r8x"", ""GHSA-3v33-3wmw-3785"", ""GHSA-42h4-v29r-42qg"", ""GHSA-69qj-pvh9-c5wg"", ""GHSA-6v4j-43gg-vj32"", ""GHSA-79w7-vh3h-8g4j"", ""GHSA-c6mh-fpjc-4pr3"", ""GHSA-f7j3-774f-rfhj"", ""GHSA-g3gw-q23r-pgqm"", ""GHSA-hjq6-52gw-2g7p"", ""GHSA-v8mc-9377-rwjj"", ""GHSA-vx4q-3cr2-7cg2"", ""PYSEC-2026-2063"", ""PYSEC-2026-2064"", ""PYSEC-2026-2065"", ""PYSEC-2026-2066"", ""PYSEC-2026-2067"", ""PYSEC-2026-3430"", ""PYSEC-2026-3431"", ""PYSEC-2026-3432"", ""PYSEC-2026-3433"", ""PYSEC-2026-3622""]}]"
yt-search-download,"YouTube 视频搜索、下载视频、下载字幕工具。结合 YouTube Data API v3 进行高级搜索，yt-dlp 下载视频/音频/字幕。
核心能力：全站关键词搜索、频道浏览、按时间/播放量/相关度排序、下载视频、提取音频（MP3）、下载字幕（中英文）、查看视频详情。
触发场景（任何涉及 YouTube 的操作都应使用此 skill）：
- 搜索类：""搜索YouTube""、""YouTube搜索""、""找YouTube视频""、""搜索[频道名]最新视频""、""查找[人名]的YouTube""、""[人名]最近更新的YouTube""、""YouTube上有什么关于XXX的""
- 频道浏览类：""浏览频道""、""看看[频道名]最新视频""、""[人名]最近发了什么视频""、""[人名]YouTube更新""、""查看[频道名]的视频列表""
- 下载视频类：""下载YouTube""、""下载这个视频""、""下载YouTube视频""、""把这个视频下载下来""、""保存视频""
- 下载音频类：""提取音频""、""下载音频""、""YouTube转MP3""、""只要音频""
- 下载字幕类：""下载字幕""、""提取字幕""、""获取字幕""、""下载YouTube字幕""、""中文字幕""、""英文字幕""、""提取文字""、""视频转文字""、""获取视频文本""
- 视频信息类：""视频详情""、""视频信息""、""这个视频多长""
关键词匹配：只要用户消息中出现 ""YouTube""、""油管""、""YT""、""yt"" 加上搜索/下载/字幕/频道/视频等动作词，就应触发此 skill。",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/joeseesun/yt-search-download/yt-search-download/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/joeseesun/yt-search-download/yt-search-download/SKILL.md,1,,0,,281ee7dcfa96a65cd88e5dd5e9973d9a94b2cef6,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""yt-dlp"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install yt-dlp     # 或 pip 安装""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""yt-dlp"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 22, ""max_severity"": ""HIGH"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-3ch3-jhc6-5r8x"", ""GHSA-3v33-3wmw-3785"", ""GHSA-42h4-v29r-42qg"", ""GHSA-69qj-pvh9-c5wg"", ""GHSA-6v4j-43gg-vj32"", ""GHSA-79w7-vh3h-8g4j"", ""GHSA-c6mh-fpjc-4pr3"", ""GHSA-f7j3-774f-rfhj"", ""GHSA-g3gw-q23r-pgqm"", ""GHSA-hjq6-52gw-2g7p"", ""GHSA-v8mc-9377-rwjj"", ""GHSA-vx4q-3cr2-7cg2"", ""PYSEC-2026-2063"", ""PYSEC-2026-2064"", ""PYSEC-2026-2065"", ""PYSEC-2026-2066"", ""PYSEC-2026-2067"", ""PYSEC-2026-3430"", ""PYSEC-2026-3431"", ""PYSEC-2026-3432"", ""PYSEC-2026-3433"", ""PYSEC-2026-3622""]}]"
