zenstack-project-setup,"Set up, configure, and manage a ZenStack V3 project. Use when installing ZenStack, scaffolding a new project, or running the `zen` CLI (generate). (For database schema migrations use zenstack-db-migration; to migrate a Prisma project use zenstack-migrate-from-prisma; to upgrade from ZenStack V2 use zenstack-migrate-from-v2.)",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zenstackhq/skills/zenstack-project-setup/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zenstackhq/skills/zenstack-project-setup/SKILL.md,1,,0,,8922e618e907d645d26507b793f10b0e22ee4ebf,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""mysql2"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""| MySQL      | `npm install mysql2` |""}]",C,"[{""package"": ""mysql2"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 5, ""max_severity"": ""CRITICAL"", ""advisory_ids"": [""GHSA-49j4-86m8-q2jw"", ""GHSA-4rch-2fh8-94vw"", ""GHSA-fpw7-j2hg-69v5"", ""GHSA-mqr2-w7wj-jjgr"", ""GHSA-pmh2-wpjm-fj45""]}]"
