zerion,"Install, configure, and troubleshoot zerion — the unified CLI for wallet analysis and autonomous trading. Covers setup, authentication (API key, x402, agent tokens), wallet management, and the end-to-end agent workflow.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion/SKILL.md,1,,1,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,55ae11326cbc9aa76e3436db59add62ed4b335df,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g zerion""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-agent-management,"Manage Zerion agent tokens and security policies — the primitives for autonomous trading and signing. Create / list / use / revoke agent tokens; create / list / show / delete policies (chain locks, allowlists, transfer/approval gates, expiry). Use whenever the user asks to set up an agent token, configure a policy, or enable autonomous trading. Required by `zerion-trading` and `zerion-sign`.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-agent-management/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-agent-management/SKILL.md,1,,0,,0258c606acdaca63b58b724fa1cb0fc2b11793ad,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g zerion-cli""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-analyze,"Read-only crypto wallet insights via the Zerion CLI: portfolio value, token holdings, DeFi positions, transaction history, PnL, and watchlist management. Use whenever the user asks 'what's in this wallet', 'how is X doing', portfolio/PnL/positions/transactions for any address, ENS name, local wallet, or watched address. Supports x402 / MPP pay-per-call. Pair with `zerion-trading` for execution after analysis.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-analyze/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-analyze/SKILL.md,1,,0,,7ff1abce9a7dba8cad36ed68e81b2f9338082443,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g zerion-cli""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-bankr,"Research wallets with Zerion CLI (portfolios, positions, PnL, history across 41+ chains), then execute every action with Bankr — spot swaps, cross-chain bridges, DCA/limit/stop-loss automation, Hyperliquid leverage, Polymarket bets, transfers, NFT trades, and token deployment. Bankr signs and broadcasts from its own multi-chain wallet (Base, Ethereum, Polygon, Solana, Unichain); Zerion stays read-only.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-bankr/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-bankr/SKILL.md,1,,0,,cec9627a0034ffb595651e0395a0136f5e3a19c8,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g zerion-cli""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-cli,"Install, configure, and troubleshoot the Zerion CLI for crypto wallet data. Use when setting up authentication, checking CLI status, or debugging connection issues. For actual wallet queries, use the wallet-analysis skill.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-cli/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-cli/SKILL.md,1,,0,,7fc31087a2f78038f8e6632488c6ff1a745b8031,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g zerion-cli""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-lifi-earn,"Discover yield vaults across 20+ chains and deposit into them from any chain in one transaction using the LI.FI Earn API for vault discovery and LI.FI Composer-powered execution. Zerion CLI funds the wallet beforehand and verifies the resulting DeFi position. Use when the user asks to 'find the best vault', 'deposit into a vault', 'earn yield on Base/Polygon/Ethereum', 'bridge and stake', 'put tokens into DeFi', or 'discover top APY for USDC'. Covers ERC-4626 vaults and major lending markets — coverage varies by chain.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-lifi-earn/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-lifi-earn/SKILL.md,1,,0,,bee7f2d57c11d6c71e3daeca777ecf6d2ea2d8f0,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- Zerion CLI + key: `npm install -g zerion-cli; export ZERION_API_KEY=\""zk_...\""`""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-monad-addresses,"Canonical Monad mainnet smart contract addresses for use with Zerion CLI: bridged stablecoins (USDC, USDT0, USD1, AUSD), wrapped MON, signing canonicals (Permit2, ERC-4337, ERC-6492), wallet primitives (Multicall3, Safe), ERC-8004 trustless-agent registries, and DEX / aggregator / cross-chain router addresses for `zerion agent create-policy --allowlist` lockdown. Points at the official monad-crypto/token-list and monad-crypto/protocols repos as authoritative fallbacks, with a one-line `cast code` verification recipe before any address is used.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-monad-addresses/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-monad-addresses/SKILL.md,1,,0,,bf4f526bd4c2e27d0954ac9c3026c3e9b340088b,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- Zerion CLI: `npm install -g zerion-cli`""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-partner-skill-creator,Guide for partners contributing skills to zerion-ai. Explains how to combine your product with Zerion CLI commands in a single SKILL.md.,NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-partner-skill-creator/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-partner-skill-creator/SKILL.md,1,,0,,f0e2b912d60735136d44fdf3cb1ffcfea1aeb79e,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""- Zerion CLI: `npm install -g zerion-cli`""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-sendai-ideas,"Crypto idea discovery, validation, competitive landscape, and DeFi market research — adapted from SendAI's solana-new idea skills. Use when a user asks 'what should I build in crypto', 'validate this idea', 'who are my competitors', 'show me TVL data', or wants a structured interview/scoring/landscape pass on a crypto product idea. SendAI surfaces the idea; the Zerion CLI (`zerion analyze`, `zerion history`, `zerion positions`) provides on-chain validation before you build.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-sendai-ideas/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-sendai-ideas/SKILL.md,1,,0,,37dd90dab88e392471e56bc05f43b0dd519e2482,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g zerion-cli""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-trading,"Execute on-chain trading actions via the Zerion CLI: swap, bridge, and send tokens across 14 EVM chains and Solana. Use whenever the user asks to swap / trade / convert tokens, bridge across chains, or transfer tokens to an address. Always uses an API key + agent token (no pay-per-call). Pair with `zerion-agent-management` to set up tokens/policies first, and `zerion-analyze` to check positions before trading.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-trading/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-trading/SKILL.md,1,,0,,127548f6572413032bffd72006ede5535e6b861b,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -g zerion-cli""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-trails-crosschainswap,"Cross-chain token swaps to and from Polygon (chainId 137) using the Trails SDK, with Zerion CLI on top for funding and portfolio checks. Use when the user wants to bridge or swap tokens across chains where Polygon is the source or destination — e.g. 'swap ETH on Ethereum to USDC on Polygon', 'bridge USDC from Arbitrum to Polygon', or 'swap to POL from any chain'. Supports Widget (drop-in React UI), Headless hooks (custom UX), and Direct API (server-side) integration modes.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-trails-crosschainswap/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-trails-crosschainswap/SKILL.md,1,,0,,7934c5a5c9c0fbbf5119a546207f358dbe2bc2b1,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""Trails handles the swap; the Zerion CLI handles everything around it — funding the wallet beforehand and verifying the position afterward. Install with `npm i -g zerion-cli`.""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
zerion-trails-deposit,"Deposit tokens into DeFi vaults on Polygon (chainId 137) using the Trails SDK, with Zerion CLI on top for funding and portfolio checks. Handles cross-chain bridging + vault deposit in a single intent: user sends tokens from any chain and they land directly in the vault. Supports Aave, Morpho, and custom ERC-4626 vaults via composable actions or calldata. Use when the user asks to 'deposit into a vault', 'earn yield on Polygon', 'bridge and stake', or 'put tokens into a DeFi protocol on Polygon'.",NeverSight,learn-skills.dev,194,search_rank=855,search,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev,https://github.com/NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/blob/HEAD/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-trails-deposit/SKILL.md,NeverSight/learn-skills.dev/data/skills-md/zeriontech/zerion-ai/zerion-trails-deposit/SKILL.md,1,,0,,b7e73b3bd30dd476200c6fa8943043cc41c0de00,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""Trails handles the bridge + vault deposit; the Zerion CLI handles funding the wallet beforehand and confirming the vault position afterward. Install with `npm i -g zerion-cli`.""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""zerion-cli"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
