tooluniverse-single-cell,"Production-ready single-cell and expression matrix analysis using scanpy, anndata, and scipy. Performs scRNA-seq QC, normalization, PCA, UMAP, Leiden/Louvain clustering, differential expression (Wilcoxon, t-test, DESeq2), cell type annotation, per-cell-type statistical analysis, gene-expression correlation, batch correction (Harmony), trajectory inference, and cell-cell communication analysis. NEW: Analyzes ligand-receptor interactions between cell types using OmniPath (CellPhoneDB, CellChatDB), scores communication strength, identifies signaling cascades, and handles multi-subunit receptor complexes. Integrates with ToolUniverse gene annotation tools (HPA, Ensembl, MyGene, UniProt) and enrichment tools (gseapy, PANTHER, STRING). Supports h5ad, 10X, CSV/TSV count matrices, and pre-annotated datasets. Use when analyzing single-cell RNA-seq data, studying cell-cell interactions, performing cell type differential expression, computing gene-expression correlations by cell type, analyzing tumor-immune communication, or answering questions about scRNA-seq datasets.",BioTender-max,awesome-bio-agent-skills,136,search_rank=473,search,https://github.com/BioTender-max/awesome-bio-agent-skills,https://github.com/BioTender-max/awesome-bio-agent-skills/blob/HEAD/skills/openclaw/tooluniverse-single-cell/SKILL.md,BioTender-max/awesome-bio-agent-skills/skills/openclaw/tooluniverse-single-cell/SKILL.md,1,,3,"BioTender-max/awesome-bio-agent-skills, mims-harvard/tooluniverse",e97ace1c28f172ff85c9a367d44081e3ab8e6542,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""anndata"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install scanpy anndata leidenalg umap-learn harmonypy gseapy pandas numpy scipy scikit-learn statsmodels""}, {""package"": ""leidenalg"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install scanpy anndata leidenalg umap-learn harmonypy gseapy pandas numpy scipy scikit-learn statsmodels""}, {""package"": ""pandas"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"