oxlint,"Lint JavaScript/TypeScript at blazing speed with oxlint — a Rust-based linter 50-100x faster than ESLint. Use when someone asks to ""speed up linting"", ""oxlint"", ""fast JavaScript linter"", ""replace ESLint"", ""Rust linter for JS"", or ""lint in CI faster"". Covers rule configuration, ESLint migration, framework plugins, and CI integration.",TerminalSkills,skills,121,search_rank=564,search,https://github.com/TerminalSkills/skills,https://github.com/TerminalSkills/skills/blob/HEAD/skills/oxlint/SKILL.md,TerminalSkills/skills/skills/oxlint/SKILL.md,1,,0,,aed7459fd0d387eb847062e2764517fbdf7ded93,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""lint-staged"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -D lint-staged""}, {""package"": ""oxlint"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""install_command"": ""npm install -D oxlint""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""lint-staged"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""oxlint"", ""ecosystem"": ""npm"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
