gget,"Fast CLI/Python queries to 20+ bioinformatics databases. Use for quick lookups: gene info, BLAST/BLAT, viral sequence downloads, AlphaFold structures, enrichment analysis, OpenTargets, COSMIC, CELLxGENE, and 8cube mouse specificity/expression data. Best for interactive exploration and simple queries. For batch processing or advanced BLAST use biopython; for multi-database Python workflows use bioservices.",K-Dense-AI,claude-scientific-skills,,,officialskills.sh,https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/claude-scientific-skills,https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/claude-scientific-skills/blob/HEAD/skills/gget/SKILL.md,K-Dense-AI/claude-scientific-skills/skills/gget/SKILL.md,1,,0,,7f74349728d3d8df8af7a7a19752e5f7776f13c8,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""gget"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""- Pin the known-good version for reproducible environments: `uv pip install \""gget==0.30.5\""`""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""gget"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
