muon-multiomics-singlecell,"Multi-modal single-cell analysis with muon/MuData. Joint RNA+ATAC (10x Multiome), CITE-seq (RNA+protein), other multi-omics. MuData holds per-modality AnnData with shared obs. WNN joint embedding, per-modality preprocessing, MOFA factor analysis. Use scanpy-scrna-seq for single-modality RNA; use muon when combining 2+ omics from the same cells.",BioTender-max,awesome-bio-agent-skills,,,,https://github.com/BioTender-max/awesome-bio-agent-skills,https://github.com/BioTender-max/awesome-bio-agent-skills/blob/HEAD/skills/sciagent/muon-multiomics-singlecell/SKILL.md,BioTender-max/awesome-bio-agent-skills/skills/sciagent/muon-multiomics-singlecell/SKILL.md,1,,0,,c797c9342a27a67fffac279a0586da6d5dc50d40,,,,,,,"[{""package"": ""anndata"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install \""muon[all]\"" \""scanpy[leiden]\"" anndata""}, {""package"": ""scanpy"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""install_command"": ""pip install \""muon[all]\"" \""scanpy[leiden]\"" anndata""}]",A,"[{""package"": ""anndata"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}, {""package"": ""scanpy"", ""ecosystem"": ""pip"", ""vuln_count"": 0, ""max_severity"": ""none"", ""advisory_ids"": []}]"
